      "side": 1,
      "message": "We believe find_lowest_rq() hook is the best place to implement any vendor changes as we go through that path from RT load balancer (push \u0026 pull algo) and we also will have lowest_mask available at that time which avoids duplication of code. We don\u0027t really need multiple hooks in case of RT. \n\nAlso, IMHO, we should always invoke find_lowest_rq() when respective hook is enabled irrespective of select_task_rq_rt hook is registered or not to find suitable CPU than just sticking to previous CPU.",
